<title>USA: Firm holds 7.7 pct Aladdin Knowledge stake.</title>
<headline>Firm holds 7.7 pct Aladdin Knowledge stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mills Value Adviser Inc, a Richmond, Va., investment advisory firm, said Monday it had acquired a 7.7 percent stake or 778,990 common shares in Aladdin Knowledge Systems Ltd.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the firm said it bought the stake for $8.966 million, for investment purposes on behalf of its clients.</p>
